        "original_id": "25285712-b74f-5524-9c11-f45ce2b8b7b7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rico Blanco\n- Organizations: Rivermaya, Kodaline, 21 Demands\n- Places: Philippines, Ireland, Dublin\n- Roles: songwriter, vocalist, guitarist, keyboardist, solo artist\n- Products: \"Give Me a Minute\"\n- Topics: rock bands, music careers, chart releases\n\nFacts:\n- Rivermaya is a Filipino rock band.\n- Kodaline are an Irish band.\n- In March 2007, Dublin rock band 21 Demands released the song \"Give Me a Minute.\"\n- \"Give Me a Minute\" reached the Irish Singles Chart for the chart dated 22 March 2007.\n- From 1994 until 2007, Rico Blanco was a founding member of the Filipino rock band Rivermaya and served as its chief songwriter, vocalist, guitarist, and keyboardist.\n- Since 2008, Rico Blanco has been a solo artist.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
